e bands, respectively; 4,5, and 6: the samples from three single embryos without green fluorescence showing negativeresults for HBs DNA; 7: the negative control (&#x02212;RT); 8: the negative control (&#x02212;T).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="JBB2008-495436.006"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>